      "description": "<p>Demonstrators are demanding resignation of Edi Rama after three days of clashes in Tirana</p><p>Albania’s prime minister, Edi Rama, has said he will not resign over student-led demonstrations, as protesters and police clashed in the country’s capital for a third consecutive day.</p><p>Police used teargas and water cannon to disperse demonstrators marching along several main roads around Tirana, while protests spread to other cities.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/15/albania-prime-minister-edi-rama-vows-not-to-resign-student-led-protests\">Continue reading...</a>",
